<programme start="20261020214500 +0000" stop="20261020220800 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Stan Against Evil</title><sub-title lang="en">Let Your Love Groan</sub-title><desc lang="en">Stan, Evie and Denise go speed dating and suddenly find themselves involved with their perfect match; they also find themselves growing weak and rapidly aging.</desc><credits><actor>John C. McGinley</actor><actor>Janet Varney</actor><actor>Nate Mooney</actor></credits><category lang="en">Sitcom</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13143367_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261020220800 +0000" stop="20261020223000 +0000" channel="AMC+ 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Stan Against Evil</title><sub-title lang="en">Life Orr Death</sub-title><desc lang="en">Evie attempts to rescue Stan&apos;s prized possession, his Bobby Orr hockey stick, from the church donation pile, only to find herself transported into the spirit world where she too, is on trial for witchcraft.</desc><credits><actor>John C. McGinley</actor><actor>Janet Varney</actor><actor>Nate Mooney</actor></credits><category lang="en">Sitcom</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13143367_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
