<programme start="20261020105800 +0000" stop="20261020112700 +0000" channel="Curiosity 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Lightbulb Moment</title><sub-title lang="en">Interstate: How the Interstate Connected and Divided America</sub-title><desc lang="en">Dwight Eisenhower&apos;s interstate highway system was the biggest infrastructure project of its time, a bold plan to connect all corners of America and boost the post-war economy, but it also ended up deepening the divide between rich and poor.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p19437807_b_v11_af.jpg"/></programme>
