<programme start="20261021135700 +0000" stop="20261021142500 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">Tale of Two Brothers</sub-title><desc lang="en">Growing up in Detroit alongside his brother Meech, Terry reflects on their journey; the Flenory family faced the threat of losing everything, pushing the brothers to the drug trade; however, success in the game often comes with deadly rivalries.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261021142500 +0000" stop="20261021145300 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">With the Streets Comes the Violence</sub-title><desc lang="en">Caught in a longstanding neighborhood rivalry, Terry is shot, prompting the brothers to shift from street level sales to wholesale in a bid to escape the violence; a move that ultimately begins to draw the attention of law enforcement.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_i_s4_ac.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261021145300 +0000" stop="20261021152200 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">The Rise of Black Mafia Family</sub-title><desc lang="en">Terry and Meech arrive in LA. With a steady supply and a trusted network of drivers to move their product nationwide, the Black Mafia Family is officially born; law enforcement ramps up their investigation.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261021152200 +0000" stop="20261021155000 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">The Sleeping Giant</sub-title><desc lang="en">In Atlanta, Meech wants to expand by launching BMF Entertainment and stepping into the music industry; a deadly shooting at Atlanta&apos;s hottest nightclub puts BMF in the spotlight, bringing unwanted attention and causing a rift between the brothers.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261021155000 +0000" stop="20261021161800 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">Down to the Wire</sub-title><desc lang="en">As law enforcement tightens their grip, a wiretap on Terry Flenory&apos;s phone provides a critical breakthrough; the divide between the brothers grows, eventually splitting BMF into two separate divisions.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261021161800 +0000" stop="20261021164700 +0000" channel="Starz In Black (East) 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The BMF Documentary: Blowing Money Fast</title><sub-title lang="en">The Fall of an Empire</sub-title><desc lang="en">By 2005, law enforcement is closing in on BMF, forcing Terry underground; as the empire collapses, the brothers face life sentences; years later, Terry reflects on their choices, redemption and the lasting impact of BMF as he begins a new chapter.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p22882210_b_v12_ae.jpg"/></programme>
